---
import { releasesURL } from '../config';
---

<section class="closing-section" id="setup">
  <div class="wrap closing-card">
    <div class="closing-orb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <span class="eyebrow"><i></i> Clear visibility. No control buttons.</span>
    <h2>Know what your proxies<br /><span>are doing.</span></h2>
    <p>Start with one HAProxy stats URL. Add the rest when you’re ready.</p>
    <a class="button button-primary" href={releasesURL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get Proxyglass <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    <a class="closing-docs" href="#how-it-works">Or start with the config example ↑</a>
    <span class="closing-footnote">Proxyglass is read-only by design.</span>
  </div>
</section>
